// SSH authorized_keys Written From the Command Line
// Sigma rule: rules/sigma/linux/lnx_authorized_keys_write.yml (4037157a-4100-44be-bb53-d21c84d7422e)
// Level: medium. ATT&CK: T1098.004 SSH Authorized Keys
// Generated by `python -m detlab build`. Change the Sigma rule, not this file.
any where (host.os.type:"linux" and event.category:"process" and event.type:"start") and (process.command_line:"*authorized_keys*" and (process.command_line like~ ("*>>*", "*> /*", "*> ~*", "*tee *")))
